### TC01 - Health Check
GET http://localhost:8888/health

### TC02 - List Books
GET http://localhost:8888/books

### TC03 - Filter Books
GET http://localhost:8888/books?author=hùng&limit=1

### TC04 - Book Detail
GET http://localhost:8888/books/1

### TC05 - Book Not Found
GET http://localhost:8888/books/999

### TC06 - Create Book
POST http://localhost:8888/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "9786040000042",
  "title": "Phát triển Web API với FastAPI",
  "author": "Lê Minh Tuấn",
  "year": 2024,
  "quantity": 4
}

### TC07 - Duplicate ISBN
POST http://localhost:8888/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "9786040000042",
  "title": "Phát triển Web API với FastAPI",
  "author": "Lê Minh Tuấn",
  "year": 2024,
  "quantity": 4
}

### TC08 - Invalid Book
POST http://localhost:8888/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "123",
  "title": "Sách lỗi",
  "author": "Test",
  "year": 1800,
  "quantity": 1
}

### TC09 - Update All
PUT http://localhost:8888/books/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "9786040000042",
  "title": "Phát triển Web API với FastAPI (Đã sửa)",
  "author": "Lê Minh Tuấn",
  "year": 2024,
  "quantity": 5
}

### TC10 - Update Partial
PATCH http://localhost:8888/books/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 10
}

### TC11 - Delete Book
DELETE http://localhost:8888/books/4

### TC12 - Verify Deleted
GET http://localhost:8888/books/4   